B.a5D=new A.iM("What we store","When you start the demo we create an anonymous workspace for you. We do not ask for your name, email address or phone number to start. We store the items, stock movements, photos and settings you enter, a technical identifier for your anonymous account, and the time your demo started. The start time is also kept in your browser so that the one-hour period continues if you leave and come back.")
B.a5w=new A.iM("Sample data","Your workspace begins with a fictional sample shop so you can try the app. It is not real data and you can clear it at any time.")
B.a5u=new A.iM("Where it is stored","Workspace data is stored on Google Firebase services operated for Cloudora.")
B.a5x=new A.iM("Information you choose to send us","If you use the feedback form or ask for a consultation or an upgrade, we receive the details you submit and use them to reply to you. The feedback form is hosted by Google Forms.")
B.a5y=new A.iM("Your choices","You can edit or delete your items and clear the sample data at any time inside the app. To ask a question about your demo data, or to ask for it to be deleted, contact us at  support@cloudora.africa.")
