B.a5s=new A.iM("Sample data and your data","The sample shop is fictional. Please do not treat the demo workspace as your only record of your stock. Before the demo ends you can download your items and stock history as CSV files.")
B.a5B=new A.iM("Upgrading","StockSense is a monthly subscription with Basic, Pro and Premium plans, priced in US dollars by team size. A one-time deployment fee of 20% of your monthly plan covers setup and onboarding. To keep using StockSense, choose a plan and our team will contact you to set up your account. Final terms are confirmed when you upgrade.")
