B.bf9=new A.m2("How long does the demo last?","The demo lasts one hour from the moment you start it. Before it ends you can download your items and stock history as CSV files.")
B.bf7=new A.m2("Do I need to create an account?","No. The demo starts with one tap, with no sign-up and no password. It remembers your workspace on this browser for the hour.")
B.bf4=new A.m2("Can I try it with my own products?","Yes. Add your own products and photos, or clear the sample data and start with an empty shop.")
B.bfa=new A.m2("How is StockSense priced?","StockSense is a monthly subscription with three plans: Basic, Pro and Premium. Each plan has prices by team size. A one-time deployment fee of 20% of your monthly plan covers setup and onboarding.")
B.bf8=new A.m2("What is a customized deployment?","We configure StockSense around your processes: custom categories and SKU formats, integration with your POS, e-commerce platform or ERP, reorder levels for each warehouse, and reports and alerts built for your business.")
B.bf3=new A.m2("Can I scan products to add them?","Scanning uses a phone camera, so it is not part of the browser demo. Ask our team how it works on phones.")
B.bf6=new A.m2("What are AI predictions?","AI predictions estimate how many days of stock you have left for each product, based on your recent stock movements, so you can reorder in time. They are included in the Pro and Premium plans.")
B.bf5=new A.m2("What happens when the demo ends?","Access to the demo closes. To keep using StockSense, choose a plan and our team will contact you to set up your account.")
B.bfb=new A.m2("Will my demo data move to a paid plan?","Talk to our team when you upgrade and we will explain your options.")
